# Review UI

- Two panes: original file and editable extracted fields plus check results.
- Approve is the only path from this app to POST `/invoices`.
- Show verifier failures in red. Do not hide API error bodies.
- Talk to ingest (`:3001`), never to Gemini and never to the accounting API directly.
- Keep it a local tool. No auth, no design system, no extra routes.
